WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.375 --> 00:00:07.208
He sucked Buzz Cut's blood
and he's about to turn into a hemophile.

00:00:07.791 --> 00:00:10.166
Once he reaches that stage,
no one can stop him.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:14.083
Looks like I'll have to use the Heaven
Lily Clan's ultimate tour-de-force,

00:00:14.166 --> 00:00:16.375
the Blossoming of the White Lily
in order to defeat him.

00:00:16.458 --> 00:00:19.208
What are you waiting for? Unleash it now.

00:00:19.916 --> 00:00:24.166
But I need your assistance
to activate this technique.

00:00:24.541 --> 00:00:27.416
Don't be so coy.
It's not like we're going to kiss.

00:00:30.208 --> 00:00:32.375
Do we really have to...

00:00:32.458 --> 00:00:33.416
Yes.

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:35.666
The Heaven Lily Clan banned romance

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:38.291
in order for us to perfect
this exceptional skill.

00:00:38.541 --> 00:00:40.166
Kissing someone of the opposite sex can

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:42.375
-activate my bodily--
-It doesn't have to be me, right?

00:00:42.458 --> 00:00:45.625
-DaChun can do it.
-But I...

00:00:45.958 --> 00:00:47.500
Ichiro can do it.

00:00:47.583 --> 00:00:48.708
I already have a girlfriend.

00:00:48.791 --> 00:00:50.208
And she won't approve of this.

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:51.958
Dai Bo can do it.

00:00:52.083 --> 00:00:53.833
But I'm just a chicken.

00:00:54.375 --> 00:00:55.916
I can do it!

00:00:56.666 --> 00:00:57.916
Kiss me--

00:00:58.541 --> 00:00:59.916
He's too weak.

00:01:01.208 --> 00:01:04.583
Chairman Jiang, I'm seriously suspecting
that you're captivated by my...

00:01:12.958 --> 00:01:14.708
That looks horrifying.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.625
-You were indeed captivated by me.
-Maybe we didn't kiss long enough.

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:33.666
Want to try again?

00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:35.625
I think I've had enough.

00:01:39.375 --> 00:01:41.000
What was the order that I gave you?

00:01:41.958 --> 00:01:44.291
"Kill him, and bring back his sword."

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:47.291
Then why is he still alive?

00:01:50.666 --> 00:01:52.666
Because he saved me.

00:01:53.333 --> 00:01:54.625
So I owed him one.

00:01:56.875 --> 00:01:58.333
Let me repay it for you

00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:01.083
and then kill him.

00:02:54.125 --> 00:02:55.958
Chairman Jiang beautified herself.

00:03:03.625 --> 00:03:05.708
Don't get so excited
when you're seriously injured.

